            <td class="nw"><a href="/record/sources/bkclaims-legal-strategy-update/">The same, 3 August</a></td>
            <td class="wide">A strategy update leaning away from a class action and toward a private Canadian lawsuit by roughly 10 to 30 larger claimants. Product liability and negligence are named as the theories under review, and collectability rather than liability as "the larger question". Identifying any applicable insurance is listed as an early priority.</td>
          </tr>
